==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|þekkja}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*þankijaną}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*teng-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθɛhca/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛhca|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|þekkti|þekkt}}

# {{lb|is|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[know]], be [[familiar]] with{{jump|is|be familiar with|s}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''þekki''' þennan mann ekki!|I don't '''know''' this person!}}
# {{lb|is|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[recognize]], [[know]]{{jump|is|recognize|s}}
#: {{ux|is|Geir? Ég '''þekkti''' þig ekki.|Geir? I didn't '''recognize''' you.}}

